# XCU sh-jobs
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XCU.sh-jobs.001
anchor     utilities/V3_chap02.html#2.11/process group leader
class      conditional
when       UP
says       With job control on (set -m), an asynchronous list is a
           background job whose process is a process group leader: its
           process group ID equals its process ID.
test       t/001-background-job-group.sh
